From 4944d75e2135e8e7ef7228d60c952f72890e85bb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keel <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:51:24 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Control: document.import_file, for pages that embed the app

An embedding page gets no file drops and no file picker, so it had no way to bring in a STEP,
mesh, point cloud, DXF or KiCad file. document.import_file takes the file's name and bytes
(base64, in parts for large files) and imports it into the open design as a drop does, in the
background; units (mm, in, ...) answers the unit question STL and OBJ files otherwise ask.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/ui-egui/src/control.rs   |   1 +
 crates/ui-egui/src/documents.rs | 146 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 docs/control-protocol.md        |   1 +
 3 files changed, 148 insertions(+)

